  m_Name: MaiHau
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Rarety: 0
  m_Description: "Mayo, the Ice Claw, is an insect-like creature born in the heart
    of the frozen wastelands.\nOnce the loyal familiar of a powerful mage, it was
    summoned to guard those desolate, icy domains. Over years of servitude, its body
    was painfully reforged\u2014hardened by frost and magic alike.\nThough its master
    never returned from a long journey begun decades ago, Mayo still keeps watch.
    Unyielding and tireless, it guards the frozen realm with the same unwavering
    loyalty as the day it was created\u2014forever bound to a promise long forgotten
    by all but itself."
  m_SpellElements: 
  m_AutoAttack: Slicide
  m_SpecialAbility: SlIceBreaker
  m_Ultimate: XStrike
